From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [ckpt] feat: under HSDP replica 0 alone writes the model and
 optimizer shards

On a 2D mesh the replicas hold identical shards: the replica-0 rank of each shard position writes the model and
optimizer files, and every rank loads the files of its shard position. Every rank still writes its extra state.
